{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38004","headline":"病中初闻复官二首 一 · 韩偓","name":"病中初闻复官二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抽毫连夜侍明光，执靮三年从省方。\n烧玉谩劳曾历试，铄金宁爲欠周防。\n也知恩泽招谗口，还痛神只误直肠。\n闻道复官飜涕泗，属车何在水茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}